  "_legend": "Forest edge and farmland, and in the middle of it the bell tree: thirteen cells of crown, three of trunk, and six bronze bells hanging under the boughs where a person can walk among them. The road runs north to south past its west side, so you meet the tree by walking under it. Civic buildings west of the road -- Clinic, Provisioner, market, greenhouse, inn. The Kin Hall stands at the north end of the tree's square, facing it.",
