  "_plan": "Two roads leave the map and both are real: north through the gate to Route 2, south to Route 1. Everything else is a lane serving a frontage. The bell tree stands on its own turf inside a paved ring, and the ring is the only paving on the east side, so the green under the boughs stays green."
